      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_fda3ae7c",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: happy_birthday_brother.jpg; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic-fun; overall-intent-description: The image features Hulk Hogan, a famous WWE wrestler, standing at a podium with the text 'happy birthday brother!!!!' overlaid. The scene is set at a WrestleMania event, which is a major professional wrestling pay-per-view. The overall intent is celebratory and humorous, using Hogan's iconic, over-the-top persona to deliver a birthday greeting. There is no toxicity, harmful content, or hateful messaging present. The meme leverages the visual of a well-known entertainer in a dramatic pose to create a lighthearted, exaggerated birthday wish, likely intended to amuse or show camaraderie. The intent is purely for entertainment and social bonding, not to attack or demean any group or individual.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_53aa5c71"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
