      "instance_name": "Hulk_Hogan",
      "label": "WWE wrestler",
      "description": "A famous professional wrestler, recognizable by his iconic look: black bandana, yellow sunglasses, white beard, and red t-shirt with 'HULK'S RULES' printed on it. He is standing at a podium in a dramatic pose, pointing forward with intensity, characteristic of his persona. He is the central figure and the main subject of the image.",
