      "label": "birthday_celebration",
      "description": "A celebratory scene featuring Hulk Hogan delivering a birthday greeting at a WrestleMania event. The scene is characterized by Hulk Hogan's dramatic pose and the overlaid text 'happy birthday brother!!!!', creating a humorous and exaggerated birthday wish. The setting is a professional wrestling arena with WrestleMania branding in the background.",
