      "instance_name": "top_text",
      "label": "Top Text: 'happy birthday'",
      "description": "The text 'happy birthday' is a common greeting used to celebrate someone’s birthday. In the context of this meme, it is combined with Hulk Hogan’s persona to create a humorous and over-the-top birthday message. The background knowledge of this phrase as a standard birthday greeting is necessary to understand the meme’s celebratory intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
