      "label": "World Wrestling Entertainment (WWE)",
      "description": "WWE is a major American professional wrestling promotion and entertainment company. It is known for its scripted storylines, athletic competition, and entertainment value. The meme relies on the cultural recognition of WWE as a form of entertainment to understand the context of Hulk Hogan’s appearance and the WrestleMania setting.",
